# Local-only scratch: agent workspace, ad-hoc diffs, one-off helper output.
# Never gets committed. If a file here is worth keeping, move it under
# scripts/ or docs/.
scratchpad/
diff.txt

# Playwright — auth cookies + reports are per-run, never committed
.auth/
playwright-report/
test-results/

# One-off Prod investigation probes + rollout tooling. AR 2026-09-02.
# These get created ad-hoc during incidents (payables → DrCar → C4a
# rollout) and are never long-lived. Blocking them in .gitignore
# prevents two failure modes:
#   1. `vercel deploy --archive=tgz` bundles the working tree,
#      including untracked files — a broken probe (wrong enum
#      reference, stale schema import) then fails Vercel typecheck.
#   2. Accidental `git add scripts/` sweeps a probe into a commit.
# If a probe becomes worth keeping (turns into a supported ops
# runner), rename off the `probe-` prefix or drop the .mts extension
# and add an explicit exception here.
scripts/probe-*.mts
scripts/seed-*-proof*.mts
scripts/flip-*.mts
scripts/bump-*.mts
